    "detailed_description": "Travel back in time and rediscover the classic arcade shoot-'em-up with a great comic-style look! <br><br>Squid Commando is an arcade shoot-'em-up game in which you have to fight alone or in pairs in co-op mode, against the whole army of General Darken. You can choose from three characters with different weapons as you shoot down swarms of enemies through five different levels. <br><br>Non-Stop Action!<br>Whether a rafting trip in a river, driving with tanks, arming turrets.... Here you can shoot and destroy almost anything! Collect many different power-ups and upgrade your weapons! <br>Save as many prisoners as possible and travel from one mission to another! But Attention:  Watch out for dangerous alligators when you are in the water.<br><br>Compete with the best mercenaries in the world and defend your position in the online rankings.<br><br>Are you ready for an action-packed mission? Let's go!<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5 action packed Levels<br></li><li> 3 Characters with different Weapons and characteristics<br></li><li> Tanks &amp; Turrets<br></li><li> Classic Arcade Gameplay<br></li><li> Couch Co-Op<br></li><li> Online Leaderboards<br></li><li> Camera views near or far<br></li><li> Pickup Items<br></li><li> weapon upgrades &amp; flamethrower<br></li><li> Airstrike Request<br></li><li> Final Bosses<br></li><li> compatible with Steam Deck<br></li><li> Keyboard and mouse support<br></li><li> Gamepad support</li></ul>",
