    "short_description": "Squid Commando is an action-packed, classic arcade run &amp; gun game that can be played solo or in co-op.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt is bright, colorful and blowing stuff up feels good.\u201d<br />\r\nEnglish Teacher Plays<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cGuys a classic that is brought back to the present day...in fact there is so much action to put other titles to shame, adventure, exploration, and destruction are the main factors in this fantastic title that can be played in single or co-op.\u201d<br />\r\nHKS DDR<br />\r\n",
